@title Eastside Food Bank, Q3 2026
@subtitle What we distributed from July to September, for our board and donors
@author Camille Ferreira, Director
@date 2026-10-17

## Q3 at a glance

kpi Food distributed | 357,800 lbs | July to September
kpi Households served in September | 7,925 | +15.9% on July | good
kpi Pounds per household | 16.3 | steady since July | neutral
kpi Volunteer hours | 4,180 | this quarter

September distribution was up 16.6 percent on July, while the number of households we served grew 15.9 percent. The amount each household received held steady at about 16 pounds.

## By category

data food = month,Produce,Dairy,Shelf-stable,Protein; Jul,41200,12400,38600,18900; Aug,46800,13100,36900,20400; Sep,52300,14900,40200,22100
chart bar food stack unit=" lbs" title="Pounds distributed by category"

- **Produce grew fastest**, up 26.9 percent from July to September, thanks to our new partnership with three local farms that started on 2026-08-15.
- **Shelf-stable dipped in August** because a shipment from the regional network was delayed. It recovered in September.
- Dairy and protein grew steadily each month.

